island-hard58-stone-riddle-desc =
    One stone gazes the other way,
    Unlike its kin in their array.
    Lay a finger on its heart,
    And the hidden wall shall part.

island-hard60-hidden-passage-note-content =
    Behind the altar, in the solid wall,

    A stranger left a sign for me.

    Seek the stone that chills the hand.

    Beyond lies no shrine, but a path of shadows.

